Pull in the term-of graduation column with a merge; this requires no splitting.

mutate(merge(grad2,
             subset(grad2, grad.term=="Yes", select=c("id", "term")),
             by="id", suffixes=c("", ".grad"), all.x=TRUE),
       grad.status=ifelse(term >= term.grad & !is.na <http://is.na>(term.grad),
                          "Graduated", "Not graduated"))

